│ Agent skill                                                                  │
│                                                                              │
│ [ ] Install the otag skill for Claude Code, Codex and OpenCode               │
│                                                                              │
│ It teaches the agents when to use otag. It writes global agent config        │
│ (~/.agents/skills/otag and a link in ~/.claude/skills), so it is off by      │
│ default. Same as `otag skill install`.                                       │
